[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/12 But ReLU has a secret identity. It turns out that this humble
 operation  max(x, 0)  is the fundamental building block of an exotic branch of
 pure mathematics called **tropical algebra**. And a new research program, back
ed by 117 computer-verified mathematical proofs, has revealed that this connect
ion goes far deeper than anyone suspected  stretching from AI to prime numbers 
to fluid dynamics to some of the greatest unsolved problems in mathematics.[] 
 []


