[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/12 **Theorem 3.1** (Truth Set = Image). For any oracle $O$, the 
*truth set* $\text{Fix}(O) = \{x \mid O(x) = x\}$ equals the image $\text{Im}(O
) = \{O(x) \mid x \in X\}$.[] 
 []


