sponse requires sequential computation through dozens of transformer layers, ea
ch involving matrix multiplications, attention computations, normalization, and
 nonlinear activations. GPT-2 (117M parameters) executes approximately 24 major
 matrix multiplications, 12 softmax operations, 12 layer normalizations, and 12
 GELU activations per forward pass. GPT-4 amplifies this by roughly two orders 
of magnitude.[] 
