[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/12 Crazy? Absolutely. But the *structure* of this ideanested lay
ers of reality with a perception operator that maps each layer to what an embed
ded observer actually seesis a well-defined mathematical object. We call it a *
*Reality Layer Algebra**.[] 
 []

Missing character: There is no — ("2014) in font ec-lmtt12!
