Overfull \hbox (2047.90134pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 64942--64942
[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/12 Here's the key insight: if you model reality layers as elemen
ts of a complete lattice (think of it as a highly structured hierarchy of possi
ble realities, ordered from "total void" at the bottom to "ground truth" at the
 top), and the act of perception as a monotone function on this lattice, then a
 beautiful theorem from 1955the Knaster-Tarski fixed-point theoremguarantees th
at *stable realities exist*.[] 
 []

