[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/12 Back to that rotting reality. We modeled it as an information
 channel whose capacity degrades over time according to a power law: the rate o
f decay is proportional to the remaining capacity raised to a power greater tha
n 1. This "super-linear" decay captures Dick's observation that reality degrada
tion *accelerates*once it starts, it gets worse faster.[] 
 []


